## Where it ended

The last commit was June 18, 2026. The scorer held up at about 0.79. Who was buying and what they'd pay never got settled; pricing changed at least five times. Two ML pieces are unfinished: a retrieval-enriched fine-tune that was built but never evaluated, and a preprint that's still a draft.

